        <mxCell id="Eh0DZUCQheAy16XRewN5-10" value="&lt;div&gt;1. performing variable selection while retaining correlated predictors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Balances sparsity and regularization.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
